{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18874","headline":"平蔡州三首 三 · 刘禹锡","name":"平蔡州三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九衢车马浑浑流，使臣来献淮西囚。\n四夷闻风失匕筯，天子受贺登高楼。\n妖童擢髪不足数，血污城西一抔土。\n南峯无火楚泽闲，夜行不锁穆陵关。\n策勳礼毕天下泰，猛士按劒看恒山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}